 PJeOffice Pro is the work of CNJ and TRF3's PJeOffice team; none of it is in this
 package. It is fetched from CNJ's own address on the person's machine. The
 program's building blocks are Leonardo de Lima Oliveira's MIT libraries (signer4j
 and its siblings). The installer's key store writer follows the format of the JDK's
 JavaKeyStore (OpenJDK, GPL-2 with the Classpath exception); no code is copied.
